}\f0\fs24 What are the qualities of effective writing? Explain briefly. http://vustudents.ning.com\par
While writing he always think about his readers and he use to make sentences with which he can clear the points. Good writer always focus on the surround nature and time if the is writing about a journey.\par
For example: if he is traveling from US to Canada. He will mentioned like this: when we start journey the climate was good, there were no sign of clouds and rain, but when we reached Sioux City the fuel tank was almost finished and then we refuel it from Sioux, there were heavy clouds but with drizzling, the distance from Sioux to CANADA is 400 miles. Etc\par
His readers get all answers and can understand the situation by his writing.\par
\par
http://vustudents.ning.com\par
\pard     \b\par
